WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A valid signature is not permission.

00:06.000 --> 00:18.000
Agent cards can name identity, capability and evidence.
They do not automatically preserve receiver authority.

00:18.000 --> 00:30.000
Integrity, identity, authority, evidence and world truth stay separate.
Missing mandatory meaning becomes UNKNOWN, never permission.

00:30.000 --> 00:50.000
Capability only: UNKNOWN plus an exact challenge.
Trusted one-use grant: ADMIT sandbox:demo.
Production mutation or replay: DENY.

00:50.000 --> 01:04.000
25 tests. 20 named cases. 2,000 deterministic executions.
Every outcome preserves action_executed:false.

01:04.000 --> 01:14.000
Synthetic Stage-1 prototype, not production security.
github.com/Lordof2L/agent-trust-border
